    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000temi](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000temi) Magnitude 5.6 earthquake at 38.543 depth occurred on Sep 06 2026 26km SE of Santa Ana Island. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -11.0595 longitude 162.519. It impacted 4588 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
